  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>NoLongerSupported</name>
    <id>128</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>TextRemovedFromSupport</name>
      <id>72</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Warning. This driver is outdated and is no longer supported.
Using this driver is not recommended and may lead to incorrect operation.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>هشدار. این درایور منسوخ است و دیگر پشتیبانی نمی‌شود.
استفاده از این درایور توصیه نمی‌شود و ممکن است منجر به عملکرد نادرست شود.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Внимание! Данный драйвер устарел и снят с поддержки.
Использование данного драйвера не рекомендуется и может приводить к некорректной работе.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Uyarı! Bu sürücü artık kullanılmamaktadır ve destek kapsamından çıkarılmıştır.
Bu sürücünün kullanılması önerilmemektedir ve hatalı işlemlere neden olabilir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Chú ý! Driver này đã cũ hoặc không được hỗ trợ.
Không nên sử dụng driver này và có thể dẫn đến làm việc không chính xác.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Warning. This driver is outdated and is no longer supported.
Using this driver is not recommended and may lead to incorrect operation.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Warning. This driver is outdated and is no longer supported.
Using this driver is not recommended and may lead to incorrect operation.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>TextRemovedFromSupportExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>74</id>
